### Plotting the output spatio-temporal KDE

plot() of sparr package is used to plot the output as shown below.


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
# mid-month DOY for Jul–Dec
tims <- c(196, 227, 258, 288, 319, 349)  # all within 10..352
labs <- c("Jul", "Aug", "Sep", "Oct", "Nov", "Dec")

par(mfcol = c(2,3), mar = c(3,3,2,1))
for (j in seq_along(tims)) {
  i <- tims[j]
  plot(kde_yday, i, main = "", override.par = FALSE, fix.range = TRUE)
  title(main = paste("KDE -", labs[j]), cex.main = 0.9, line = 1)
}
```

